            read: "2026-10-23",
            kind: Secondary,
            registry: None,
            note: "The paper itself was NOT read. Its figures (about 3 Mt of phosphorus a year in human excreta, about 10% of it returned to farmland) were seen only in secondary accounts in search results on 2026-10-23. Used only as an Uncertain figure.",
